	(text "Key matrix (6 rows x 10 columns electrical; 4 x 12 keys + D-pad physical)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 3.0 3.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7f3fc2fe-c0d4-5861-af87-191c64b074ef"))
	(text "Each key: switch SWn in series with diode Dn (1N4148WS), anode toward the row. Diodes are kept on purpose:" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 21.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "27a9abc9-94f1-5780-b09e-9d8e095012ff"))
	(text "without them the TCA8418 reports a phantom key for three-key combinations (TI SCPS215G 9.1.1)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 25.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "52bb8e5e-59f5-5d54-b498-d5997ae753e4"))
	(text "Electrical map (kbd_layout.matrix_pos): rows 0-3 = physical rows, physical columns 0-9;" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 29.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8ae5ebf7-de29-5290-8b29-fecb5f5c4ecd"))
	(text "row 4 = physical column 10 (COL0-3) and column 11 (COL4-7); row 5 = D-pad (COL0-4)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 33.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "5047b5af-d633-57d8-8cdd-e6cc6c7a78e4"))
	(text "Both Space switches share one matrix position (ROW3/COL6): one key, one diode (K3)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 38.04 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "11943048-0e1a-561b-b0af-db56495ba144"))
	(text "Assembly (K2): the switches allow two reflows at most and must not be washed." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 42.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1a5f42dc-f907-558d-b5a5-a735e128c756"))
	(text "Every part is on the TOP side: the bottom of this board is the outside of the device. Keep the" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 46.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0911e771-b4d8-5bb0-a95c-be885dcbe4c1"))
	(text "bottom free of parts and keep its vias tented." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 50.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "717b8823-62fe-5541-8bcd-9ee1a0713b10"))
